<hidden-email>'s accord but anyways i mean anyways, thanks, ) in thorough detail
+how to achieve that, which helped a lot. I had given to @f1rpo slightly
+different names for the categories than the one i provided here at the
+"rename" bullet points above, but the explanation should be mostly
+(almost entirely in fact) the same (minus these name differences).
